#","^EdrickChoice","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^This is the one time to explore what's outside the city. Why not do that? ","#","^EdrickChoice","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","#","^Yael","/#","^Indeed. My father taught me everything, and one of the things he stressed most was that a stress free environment leads to a stress free life.","\n",["ev","str","^I see... that's very true. ","#","^EdrickChoice","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"TALK"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","#","^Yael","/#","^Why would I do that? It's dangerous out here. And I would have to bring Jasper. No thank you.","\n",{"->":"TALK"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","#","^Yael","/#","^Of course. My favorite is the <i>Starlight Mansion</i>. A work of fiction by the finest author in the city. I bought it on release, and the protective cloth cover is still there.","\n",["ev","str","^How long did it take you to read those? ","#","^EdrickChoice","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","#","^YaelPensive","/#","^I'm a slow reader. The first book took me two years.","\n",["ev","str","^You should probably get reading, then. ","#","^EdrickChoice","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"TALK"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","#","^YaelPensive","/#","^Before I was chosen, I was engaged. A magistrate in the city. I knew there was no guarantee I would come back, so we called it off. But the rings stay on.","\n",["ev","str","^That's sweet. ","#","^EdrickChoice","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"TALK"},"end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"IncreaseTension":[{"temp=":"amount"},"ev",{"VAR?":"tension"},{"VAR?":"amount"},"+","/ev",{"VAR=":"tension","re":true},{"#f":1}],"DecreaseTension":[{"temp=":"amount"},"ev",{"VAR?":"tension"},{"VAR?":"amount"},"-","/ev",{"VAR=":"tension","re":true},{"#f":1}],"SetJaspersWay":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"jaspersWay","re":true},{